---
description: Default PR assignees — in-chat picker via gh-pr-assign-harness
alwaysApply: true
---

Harness: `gh-pr-roster-json`, config `~/.config/gh/pr-default-assignees.json`.

**Before `gh pr create` (stay in chat):**

1. Run `gh-pr-roster-json`. Use **AskQuestion** `allow_multiple: true` with `options` from roster.
2. First option `__use_defaults__` = one-tap defaults only.
3. Chat shortcuts `defaults` / `yes` → use `defaults` array from roster.
4. Map ids to `--assignee` (never pass `__use_defaults__` to gh).
5. Use `default_gh_host` from config (`git.dev.box.net` on Box). Set `GH_HOST` only when overriding.
6. Do not open desktop UI during normal PR flow unless user asks to edit roster.